Upstream-bound: no
Subject: [PORT_HOST] P3.5 authentic album via STCRDSHP pack open

Gate FORCE_CARD_WIN host addCards behind DW3_FORCE_CARD_WIN_ADDCARDS
(default off). DW3_FORCE_PACK_OPEN seeds pack item 91, selects Open Pack,
confirms pack open so vanilla GAME.funcs.addCards updates cardsSeen;
logs STCRDSHP_openPack cardsSeen delta; AFTER_CARD_ALBUM waits for field
then opens STCRDABM (leaves shop to fieldMode after pack).

